      <span class="card-toggle">▾</span>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body open">
      <div class="rule-box"><strong>Goodwill:</strong> Only recorded when an <em>entire business</em> is purchased.</div>

      <div class="formula">
        <span class="formula-label">Goodwill Calculation</span>
        Goodwill = Purchase Price − FMV of Net Identifiable Assets (Assets − Liabilities)
      </div>

      <div class="formula" style="border-left-color: var(--accent3)">
        <span class="formula-label">Bargain Purchase (Purchase Price &lt; FMV of Net Assets)</span>
        Record a GAIN (not negative goodwill on the balance sheet)
      </div>

      <ul>
        <li>Goodwill is <strong>never amortized</strong></li>
        <li>Tested for impairment <strong>at least annually</strong></li>
        <li>Conceptually = future economic benefits of <em>unidentifiable</em> assets (synergies, brand, workforce, etc.)</li>
