<!-- ══════════════════════════════ CHEAT SHEET ══════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="chapter" id="cheatsheet">

  <div class="section-card">
    <div class="card-header" onclick="toggleCard(this)">
      <span class="card-num">★</span>
      <span class="card-title">Master Cheat Sheet — All Chapters</span>
      <span class="card-toggle">▾</span>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body open">

      <h3>Ch. 9 — PP&E Quick Rules</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Land: never depreciated; subtract salvaged material proceeds</li>
        <li>Self-constructed: capitalize <strong>lesser</strong> of avoidable vs. actual interest</li>
        <li>WAAE × rate = avoidable interest; interest cap period ends at substantial completion</li>
        <li>Nonmonetary exchange: always update depreciation first; commercial substance → recognize all G/L immediately</li>
        <li>No commercial substance + gain + cash received &gt; 25% → recognize entire gain</li>
      </ul>

      <hr>
      <h3>Ch. 10 — Depreciation Quick Rules</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>DDB: do NOT subtract SV from base; stop at BV = SV</li>
        <li>SYD: use remaining years / sum for fraction; sum = n(n+1)/2</li>
        <li>Estimate change → prospective; no prior restatement</li>
        <li>Impairment: BV &gt; undiscounted CF → impaired; loss = BV − FV</li>
        <li>Depletion base includes ARO (restoration costs)</li>
      </ul>

      <hr>
      <h3>Ch. 11 — Intangibles Quick Rules</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Internally generated intangibles → expense (except legal defense costs)</li>
        <li>Limited-life → amortize; Indefinite-life → do NOT amortize</li>
        <li>Goodwill: only on full business purchase; never amortized; annual impairment test</li>
        <li>R&amp;D → expense, EXCEPT equipment with alternative future use → capitalize &amp; depreciate</li>
        <li>Bargain purchase (Price &lt; FMV net assets) → record Gain</li>
      </ul>

      <hr>
      <h3>Ch. 16 — Investments Quick Rules</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>HTM: amortized cost; no unrealized G/L recognized</li>
        <li>Trading: FV; unrealized G/L → Net Income</li>
        <li>AFS: FV; unrealized G/L → OCI (equity, not income)</li>
        <li>&lt;20% → Fair Value method; dividends = revenue</li>
        <li>20–50% → Equity method; investee NI increases investment account; dividends reduce it</li>
        <li>Equity method: NO fair value adjustments at year end</li>
      </ul>

      <hr>
      <h3>Key Formulas at a Glance</h3>
      <div class="formula">
        WAAE: Each Expenditure × (Months Outstanding ÷ 12)<br>
        Avoidable Interest: WAAE × Rate(s)<br>
        Capitalize: min(Avoidable, Actual)<br><br>
        DDB: (2 ÷ Life) × Book Value [no SV deduction]<br>
        SYD: (Cost − SV) × (Remaining ÷ SYD Sum)<br>
        Change in Estimate: (Remaining BV − New SV) ÷ Remaining Life<br><br>
        Goodwill: Purchase Price − FMV of Net Identifiable Assets<br>
        Impairment Loss: Book Value − Fair Value<br><br>
        Partial Gain: Total Gain × [Cash ÷ (Cash + FV Asset Received)]<br>
        Equity Method Income: Total NI × Ownership %
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div><!-- /cheatsheet -->

